cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ARMD-Predict, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
title: "ARMD-Predict"
type: software
abstract: >-
  ARMD-Predict estimates, at culture ordering and from information recorded
  up to the order, the probability that all tested organisms recovered from the
  culture will be susceptible to each candidate antibiotic: a patient-specific
  antibiogram. The models were trained on 7.4 million culture-antibiotic
  results from 415,952 culture orders in 241,227 patients at four U.S. health
  systems. Research prototype; not for clinical decision-making.
